# Mimic: a treasure chest until it opens. Idle is one closed frame.
# GandalfHardcore enemy pack (licensed to the author, not redistributable
# on its own). 64x64 cells. Row 0 idle, then the action rows. The world
# view plays IDLE, or WALK when moving, and flips to face the heading.

sheet mimic.ppm
cell 64 64

bank MIMIC
seq IDLE   loop ticks=6 : row 0 cols 0-0
seq WALK   loop ticks=2 : row 1 cols 0-7
seq ATTACK once ticks=2 : row 2 cols 0-5
seq DEATH  once ticks=3 : row 3 cols 0-6
